# The ROOT .gitignore ignores every package.json/package-lock.json (a legacy
# PWA-era rule, root .gitignore:18-19) — re-include this harness's manifest +
# lockfile, otherwise the documented `npm install` CI step (README.md) has no
# dependency list to install from. Mirrors functions/.gitignore.
!package.json
!package-lock.json
